  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.86,
      "e": 6.78,
      "text": "- [Narrator] The 202nd RED HORSE Squadron"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.78,
      "e": 8.5,
      "text": "rebuilt a road in Avon Park"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.5,
      "e": 11.05,
      "text": "after it was washed out during Hurricane Irma."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.05,
      "e": 15.22,
      "text": "- Our mission today, we're working for Highlands County"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.24,
      "e": 16.7,
      "text": "doing storm recovery."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.7,
      "e": 18.5,
      "text": "We've been doing rock clearing."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.5,
      "e": 21.14,
      "text": "Now we're down to doing some Earth work"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.14,
      "e": 25.3,
      "text": "and recovery efforts for some areas that have washed out"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.52,
      "e": 29.26,
      "text": "due to the heavy rain that the storm produced."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.26,
      "e": 30.59,
      "text": "- [Narrator] The Airfield section"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.59,
      "e": 32.19,
      "text": "is designed to be a self-contained unit"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.19,
      "e": 33.44,
      "text": "that can go anywhere in the world"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.44,
      "e": 35.26,
      "text": "to rebuilt runways and roads."
    },
    {
      "s": 35.26,
      "e": 36.27,
      "text": "- This is what we do."
    },
    {
      "s": 36.27,
      "e": 37.96,
      "text": "We're built to build airfields."
    },
    {
      "s": 37.96,
      "e": 39.83,
      "text": "That's what we do, is build airfields"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.83,
      "e": 41.58,
      "text": "or road construction."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.39,
      "e": 45.64,
      "text": "We've got material that we're gonna be back-filling with"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.64,
      "e": 47.72,
      "text": "with our own dump trucks."
    },
    {
      "s": 48.34,
      "e": 50.59,
      "text": "Sergeant Greenwell is there on the dozer."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.59,
      "e": 52.47,
      "text": "He's pushing material in and shaping it up,"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.47,
      "e": 55.51,
      "text": "getting it ready to receive the base material."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.51,
      "e": 57.03,
      "text": "- [Narrator] For the 202nd RED HORSE,"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.03,
      "e": 58.76,
      "text": "building is what they do best."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.76,
      "e": 61.03,
      "text": "And these airmen are happy to use their expertise"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.03,
      "e": 62.46,
      "text": "to help the community."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.46,
      "e": 64.33,
      "text": "- You know, we're here to do our job."
    },
    {
      "s": 64.33,
      "e": 66.37,
      "text": "Glad to be here to be part of the team"
    },
    {
      "s": 66.37,
      "e": 68.83,
      "text": "that's helping everybody get over this."
    },
    {
      "s": 68.83,
      "e": 70.4,
      "text": "I mean, it makes you feel really good"
    },
    {
      "s": 70.4,
      "e": 73.15,
      "text": "that you're here to help out your community, your state."
    },
    {
      "s": 73.15,
      "e": 75.99,
      "text": "And everybody's just really supportive, really grateful."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.99,
      "e": 79.66,
      "text": "And we're glad to be here and be part of it."
    }
